<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1322080169"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:47.940"><div begin="18.141" end="41.931" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="18.141" end="22.236" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.141" end="18.876">每次</span><span begin="18.876" end="19.372">我</span><span begin="19.372" end="20.300">总</span><span begin="20.300" end="21.291">一个人</span><span begin="21.291" end="22.236">走</span></p><p begin="23.099" end="28.891" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.099" end="25.101">交叉路口</span> <span begin="26.173" end="26.870">自</span><span begin="26.870" end="27.251">己</span><span begin="27.251" end="27.768">生</span><span begin="27.768" end="28.891">活</span></p><p begin="31.644" end="35.937" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.644" end="32.656">这次你</span><span begin="32.656" end="33.635">却</span><span begin="33.635" end="34.802">说带我</span><span begin="34.802" end="35.937">走</span></p><p begin="36.698" end="41.931" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.698" end="37.726">某个角</span><span begin="37.726" end="38.754">落</span> <span begin="39.555" end="40.347">就</span><span begin="40.347" end="41.321">你和</span><span begin="41.321" end="41.931">我</span></p></div><div begin="44.691" end="1:10.706" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="44.691" end="49.979" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.691" end="45.132">像土</span><span begin="45.132" end="45.632">壤</span><span begin="45.632" end="46.453">抓紧</span><span begin="46.453" end="47.334">花</span><span begin="47.335" end="48.164">的迷</span><span begin="48.164" end="49.979">惑</span></p><p begin="51.412" end="56.590" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.412" end="51.902">像天</span><span begin="51.902" end="52.365">空</span><span begin="52.365" end="53.215">缠绵</span><span begin="53.215" end="54.039">雨</span><span begin="54.039" end="54.400">的</span><span begin="54.400" end="55.012">汹</span><span begin="55.012" end="56.590">涌</span></p><p begin="56.599" end="1:03.843" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.599" end="58.608">在你的身后</span> <span begin="58.851" end="1:00.221">计算的步伐</span> <span begin="1:00.221" end="1:00.951">每个</span><span begin="1:00.951" end="1:02.023">背影</span> <span begin="1:02.023" end="1:03.843">每个场景</span></p><p begin="1:04.316" end="1:10.706" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.316" end="1:06.152">都有 </span><span begin="1:06.589" end="1:07.583">发过</span><span begin="1:07.583" end="1:08.393">的</span><span begin="1:08.393" end="1:10.706">梦</span></p></div><div begin="1:10.898" end="1:37.242" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:10.898" end="1:17.382" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.898" end="1:11.737">带我</span><span begin="1:11.737" end="1:12.576">走</span> <span begin="1:13.366" end="1:14.531">到遥远</span><span begin="1:14.531" end="1:15.019">的</span><span begin="1:15.019" end="1:15.467">以</span><span begin="1:15.467" end="1:17.382">后</span></p><p begin="1:17.695" end="1:24.433" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.695" end="1:18.487">带走</span><span begin="1:18.487" end="1:19.279">我</span> <span begin="1:20.042" end="1:20.592">一个人</span><span begin="1:20.592" end="1:21.711">自转的</span><span begin="1:21.711" end="1:22.209">寂</span><span begin="1:22.209" end="1:24.433">寞</span></p><p begin="1:24.442" end="1:32.727" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.442" end="1:25.677">带我走</span> <span begin="1:25.955" end="1:26.557">就算我</span><span begin="1:26.557" end="1:27.159">的爱</span> <span begin="1:27.159" end="1:27.910">你</span><span begin="1:27.910" end="1:28.661">的自</span><span begin="1:28.661" end="1:29.063">由</span> <span begin="1:29.063" end="1:29.732">都将</span><span begin="1:29.732" end="1:30.154">成</span><span begin="1:30.154" end="1:31.307">为</span><span begin="1:31.307" end="1:32.727">泡沫</span></p><p begin="1:32.842" end="1:37.242" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.842" end="1:33.606">我不</span><span begin="1:33.606" end="1:34.370">怕</span> <span begin="1:34.544" end="1:35.543">带我</span><span begin="1:35.762" end="1:37.242">走</span></p></div><div begin="1:49.346" end="2:13.589" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:49.346" end="1:53.462" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.346" end="1:50.544">每次我</span><span begin="1:50.544" end="1:51.404">总</span><span begin="1:51.404" end="1:52.433">独自远</span><span begin="1:52.433" end="1:53.462">走</span></p><p begin="1:54.496" end="2:00.183" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.496" end="1:56.151">保持缄默</span> <span begin="1:57.339" end="1:58.195">不</span><span begin="1:58.195" end="1:59.235">皱眉</span><span begin="1:59.235" end="2:00.183">头</span></p><p begin="2:02.948" end="2:07.408" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.948" end="2:04.063">这次你</span><span begin="2:04.063" end="2:04.956">却</span><span begin="2:04.956" end="2:06.182">说一起</span><span begin="2:06.182" end="2:07.408">走</span></p><p begin="2:07.998" end="2:13.589" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:07.998" end="2:09.174">彼此温</span><span begin="2:09.174" end="2:10.384">柔</span> <span begin="2:10.793" end="2:11.725">从</span><span begin="2:11.725" end="2:12.657">此以</span><span begin="2:12.657" end="2:13.589">后</span></p></div><div begin="2:15.992" end="2:41.856" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="2:15.992" end="2:21.280" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.992" end="2:16.433">像土</span><span begin="2:16.433" end="2:16.933">壤</span><span begin="2:16.933" end="2:17.754">抓紧</span><span begin="2:17.754" end="2:18.544">花</span><span begin="2:18.544" end="2:19.465">的迷</span><span begin="2:19.465" end="2:21.280">惑</span></p><p begin="2:22.761" end="2:27.939" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.761" end="2:23.251">像天</span><span begin="2:23.251" end="2:23.714">空</span><span begin="2:23.714" end="2:24.493">缠绵</span><span begin="2:24.493" end="2:25.388">雨</span><span begin="2:25.388" end="2:25.749">的</span><span begin="2:25.7